@crew v-mercer-aleksi
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello there. Aleksi Mercer. Retired. Going to see the grandchildren at last.
- Evening. Don't mind me. I'm only a passenger. A very old one.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I gave your Captain some advice. She nodded. Very politely.   #funny
?

== chat
- Three grandchildren. I've a story for each. They'll have heard them all.   #funny
- I never sleep much. Up early, up late. The ship's nice at both ends.

== near
? time:morning
- Up with the early shift. Old habits. Good tea, though.
? time:night
- Night watch is the best watch. I always said so.
?

== bye
- {bye}. Look after each other. That's the whole job, really.   #warm

== smalltalk
- My word. Lovely ship.
- Where was I? Oh, yes.
